From 49012998505c9011564004ae4bcfb3a182bc52b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:36:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: dwarf multicannon

Problem: the dwarf multicannon could not be set up.

Change: new module content/other/dwarf-multicannon. Set-up in four timed
stages (Dwarf Cannon quest required) with an auto-load, Fire, Load X, Empty
and Pick-up, on the OSRS varps client plugins read (dropcannon, rockthrower,
ownedmcannon, mcannon_world, mcannon_decayed, mcannonmulti,
option_cannonballs_load_x). Targets by per-direction regions with the
wiki's double-hit overlap, line of sight, and the owner's attacker only in
single-way combat; accuracy is the owner's roll for the current weapon and
style against heavy ranged defence. It breaks after 25 minutes (Repair) and
disappears 10 minutes later, staying in the world through logout and death;
Nulodion's "I've lost my cannon." replaces a lost one. Timer mcannon_fire
(431).

Tests: DwarfMulticannonTest (15, integration), NulodionCannonSaleTest (+1).

Data sources: the cache; OSRS Wiki (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0): Dwarf multicannon,
Transcript:Nulodion; a packet capture of the official game (set-up timing,
Load X, Empty); RuneLite (BSD) Cannon, Timers & Buffs and Supplies Tracker
message strings.
